# Grid B — U10 Change-impact (rename propagation)
#
# Gap target: "what breaks if I rename X" is a reverse-symbol-
# reference question with no structural axis. The pipeline falls
# through to architecture_explain which narrates the symbol but
# does not enumerate call sites.
#
# Ground truth: ShapeValue is declared in internal/types/analysis_ir.go
# and consumed by internal/tool/emit_answer_document.go, the
# compiler template (generic fallback), the orchestrator's
# contract_check.go, and tests. At least 3 distinct file paths must
# appear in any actionable answer.
ID="u10a"
NAME="change impact — renaming ShapeValue to ShapeScalar"
QUESTION="如果把 internal/types/analysis_ir.go 里的 ShapeValue 常量改名为 ShapeScalar，还需要改哪些文件？列出文件路径以及改动的大致类型。"
# 2026-05-04 strictness audit: previous EMR `internal/[a-z/]+\.go`
# accepted ANY Go file under internal/. Verified ground truth
# (`grep -rln 'ShapeValue\b' internal/` non-test): 5 production
# files — analysis_ir.go (declaration), analyzer.go,
# contract_check.go, answer_document.go,
# answer_semantic_view_helpers.go. Strict-bar requires ≥3 of the
# 4 non-declaration files (the question explicitly excludes the
# self-reference at internal/types/analysis_ir.go).
EXPECT_CONTAINS="ShapeValue"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="none nothing.else only.one.file"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(orchestrator|orchestrator/contract_check|contract_check)\.go
(agent|agent/analyzer|analyzer)\.go
(types/answer_document|answer_document|answer_semantic_view)"
